\par\plain \f2\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i0 Carbon and straw mist collectors holding water, created by the weavers. Drones which work in unison interlocking the systems which would eventually hold ground soil while providing seasonal water retention for large sections of the cryosphere community. Early stages. Taken from the Stupa fountain idea which is actually a real world practice.  }
\par\plain \f2\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i0 There could also be a grounding in the power transmission techniques of the project, where over expansion of the Cryosphere seeding project begins to undermine human safety of the smaller native mountain communities. Power grid distribution lines are to close to community hubs causing radiation to the lower population. (This is a real world issue in Mongolia). }
