\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i0\cb4\highlight4 - }{\f1\fs24\b1\i0\cb4\highlight4 2035}{\f2\fs24\b0\i0\cb4\highlight4 : }
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i0 The Sentient program was first founded by Dr wolfgang, sought to create more independent and self reliant robots that could carry on the cleanup activities with minimal human interaction, allowing human pilots who were suffering from the trauma related to the piloting of the cleanup crew robots initially. The intergenerational toll brought on by the cleanup proved to be catastrophic on those sent in, having a largely now known direct link to the atrocity of war.  }
\par\plain \f2\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i0 Later, as the Serva Vitae program matured, humanoid administrative machines were introduced not as the primary labor force, but as supervisory intermediaries for the remote drone facilities attached to each machine class. These humanoid units inhabited the command layer of the cleanup network, operating local control stations, coordinating repair bays, assigning machine priorities, and interfacing with legacy systems that had originally been built for human hands and human spaces. Their implementation was intentional: by removing direct human psychological involvement from the reclamation process, the program eliminated hesitation, grief-based decision making, panic responses, revulsion toward mass-casualty environments, and the moral fatigue that had crippled early post-strike cleanup efforts. The humanoid overseers did not replace the heavy machines; they replaced the human emotional burden once required to command them.}
\par\plain \f2\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i0\cb4\highlight4 - }{\f1\fs24\b1\i0\cb4\highlight4 2035-12-21}{\f2\fs24\b0\i0\cb4\highlight4 : }
\par\plain \f2\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i0 lays the technological development of self aware AI or general AI at a point in a believable part of the future, 8 years ahead of todays date. Given the current standard for robotics. Humanoid robots are largely still controlled, unable to think for themselves. }
\par\plain \f2\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i0 The facility itself also became host to the first advanced biological repair and genetic augmentation demonstrating the first scalable advances in human technology. The research led by SV1 and Wolfgang pathed the way for transcending the human mind between bodies }
