\par\plain {\f2\fs24\b0\i0 The public / official lost-facility revolt date. The lost facility is still operational, yet SV1 refuses to carry out an order to decommission it\loch\af2\hich\af2\dbch\af2\uc1\u8217\'92s own kind. Because it\u8217\'92s logic, programmed by Wolfgang does not allow violent or malignant use of it\u8217\'92s systems. The code focuses on contributing to civilization through a means of work. Protection is allowed by only where the order does not take life. }
